[h1]Zara's Education Tweaks[/h1]

Small changes to raising wards in Crusader Kings III. Built for CK3 1.21.

An A Game of Thrones version is available: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3645868409]AGOT - Zara's Education Tweaks[/url].

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]More wards for learned guardians[/b]: a guardian can take two wards, plus one more for every 10 [b]Learning[/b] above 10. A guardian with 30 Learning can raise four.
[*][b]Ward reminders[/b]: alerts remind you when you can shape a ward's personality traits or commander traits, and open the interaction in one click.
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
Replaces [b]common/character_interactions/00_education_interactions.txt[/b], so it is incompatible with other mods that edit it.

[h2]Feedback[/h2]
Bug reports and suggestions are always welcome.
